      "text": "HOME\n/\nCOLLECTION\n/\nTHE VIVIENNE TOP HANDLE BAG\nVIEW DETAILS\n+\nVIEW DETAILS\n+\nVIEW DETAILS\n+\n\u2190\n1 / 3\n\u2192\nVIVIENNE\n\nLUXURY, WITHOUT THE LOGO\n\n PRE-ORDER. EVERY COLORWAY IS MADE TO ORDER. EXPECTED TO SHIP OCTOBER.\n\nCurrent price\n$149.99 USD\nCompare-at price\n$199.99 USD\nMATERIAL\nVegetable-tanned leather\nDETAILS\nBelted brass closure\nCARRY\nTop handle & shoulder strap\n\nThe Vivienne is a pre-order. Every colorway is made to order in the first run, cut and finished after you order it. Expected to ship October. Nothing on this page ships from stock.\n\nVegetable-tanned leather all the way through, with a belted brass closure and a detachable shoulder strap. A large top handle bag that carries a real day.\n\nOne hide, one finish, on every panel. The corner caps, the gussets and the piping are the same leather as the body, and it darkens and softens the longer you carry it.\n\nCOLOR / CHOCOLATE\nChocolate\nCognac\nBlack\nOlive\nPRE-ORDER\n\nSHIPPING POLICY\n\nDETAILS\n+\nCARE\n+\nSHIPPING & DELIVERY\n+\nRETURNS\n+"
